{"id":936,"date":"2026-08-18T08:06:18","date_gmt":"2026-08-18T08:06:18","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=936"},"modified":"2026-08-20T07:51:17","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T07:51:17","slug":"image-filters-alt-text","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/graphics\/image-filters-alt-text\/","title":{"rendered":"Image Filters &#038; Alt Text"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Image Filters &amp; Alt Text<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The <strong>Picture Tools<\/strong> sidebar provides real-time, non-destructive image filter controls alongside alt text support, giving you both creative control and accessibility compliance in one place.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Image Filters<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-939 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-18-090550.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"599\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-18-090550.png 344w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-18-090550-104x300.png 104w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 208px) 100vw, 208px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">All filter adjustments are live on the canvas and applied using CSS filters &#8211; your original image file is never modified. The following controls are available in the Picture Tools sidebar:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Hue Rotation &#8211;<\/strong> Shifts the colour tones of the image across the colour wheel (0\u00b0 &#8211; 360\u00b0). Useful for recolouring clipart or creating dramatic tinted effects.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Brightness &#8211;<\/strong> Lightens or darkens the image.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Contrast &#8211;<\/strong> Increases or reduces the difference between light and dark areas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Saturate &#8211;<\/strong> Boosts or strips the colour intensity of the image.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Sepia &#8211;<\/strong> Applies a warm, vintage brown tone.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Blur &#8211;<\/strong> Softens the entire image.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Invert &#8211;<\/strong> Reverses all colours, creating a negative effect.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\"><em>Note: Filters are non-destructive while on the canvas. Before printing or exporting to PDF, they are automatically \u201cbaked\u201d into the image. The export engine waits for the filtered image source to be fully resolved before capturing the snapshot, ensuring your PDF and exported files correctly reflect all filter settings.<\/em><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Alt Text<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-947 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-083837-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"101\" height=\"107\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-083837-1.png 338w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-083837-1-284x300.png 284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 101px) 100vw, 101px\" \/>Every image in Open Publisher can have Alt Text attached for accessibility compliance. Alt text describes the image to screen readers and is embedded in all HTML exports.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">To add Alt Text:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click any image on the canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select <strong>Edit Alt Text<\/strong> from the context menu.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Type a descriptive label for the image (for example: \u201cCompany logo in teal green\u201d or \u201cBar chart showing Q1 sales\u201d).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click <strong>Save<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">The text is stored on the element&#8217;s <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">data-alt-text<\/span> attribute. It is written into the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">alt<\/span> attribute of the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;img&gt;<\/span> tag in all HTML exports, and is also reported by the <strong>Accessibility Checker<\/strong> as part of its WCAG 2.1 scan.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-943 aligncenter\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"816\" height=\"324\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833.jpeg 1613w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833-300x119.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833-1024x406.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833-768x305.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-20_082847.png_202608200833-1536x609.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 816px) 100vw, 816px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Image Filters &amp; Alt Text The Picture Tools sidebar provides real-time, non-destructive image filter controls alongside alt text support, giving you both creative control and accessibility compliance in one place. Image Filters All filter adjustments are live on the canvas and applied using CSS filters &#8211; your original image file is never modified. The following [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":950,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[13],"class_list":["post-936","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-graphics"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/936","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=936"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/936\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":948,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/936\/revisions\/948"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/950"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/